        "type": "size",
        "attrs": {
         "pt": 8
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "C – Character (burning, sharp, throbbing, dull, tingling) – L – Location (prox/dist, dermatomal, hemispheric) – O – Onset (sudden = vasc; gradual = neoplasm/degen) – R – Radiation – I – Intensity – D – Duration – E – Exacerbating factors – P – Palliative factors – A – assoc Sx – C – Concern(s)/impact on ADLs"
     }
    ]
   },
