      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "size",
        "attrs": {
         "pt": 8
        }
       }
      ],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "size",
        "attrs": {
         "pt": 8
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "⍉neurologic gait: Orthopedic/MSK → antalgic (shortened stance on painful limb), Trendelenburg (gluteus medius weak, hip pathology, L5); vasc claud → relieved by rest while standing (vs neurogenic claud relieved by flex/sitting); meds → sedatives, antihypertensives (orthostasis), polypharmacy"
     }
    ]
   },
