      "text": "Dermatome landmarks: C5 shoulder; C6 thumb; C7 middle finger; C8 pinky; C6 & T1 inner/outer forearm; T4 nipple line; T10 umbilicus; L3 anterior thigh; L4 medial malleolus; L5 dorsum of foot; S1 little toe; S3 medial buttock. CN landmarks: orbit (II, III, IV, VI), TMJ/masseter (V motor), palate & uvula (IX, X)"
     }
