         "pt": 8
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "Spinal cord pathways: Dorsal columns (fasciculus gracilis + cuneatus) — vibration, proprioception, fine touch, 2-point discrimination — ascend ipsilaterally, decussate in medulla. Lat spinothalamic tract — pain, temp, crude touch — decussates @ the cord level. Key: dissociated sensory loss (lose one, spare other) = Brown-Séquard, anterior cord, syrinx"
     }
    ]
