      ],
      "text": "Raised ICP mechanisms: mass effect (tumor, hematoma), cerebral edema, hemorrhage, CSF obstruct/hydrocephalus (Monro-Kellie doctrine: fixed skull). Cushing’s triad + papilledema + declining consciousness → herniation risk → emergent mgnt"
