        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "CHI focused exam components: mental status/GCS, pupils, CNs, motor/sensory, coord, skull inspection. Battle sign (mastoid bruising), raccoon eyes (periorbital ecchymosis), hemotympanum, CSF oto-/rhinorrhea → basilar skull frx. CHI red flags: LOC worsening, amnesia (antegrade & retrograde), progress sx → neuroimaging"
