      ],
      "text": "Neoplasm exam: Fundoscopy (papilledema), full CN testing, motor/sensory, cerebellar/coord, mental status, systemic survey (lymphadenopathy, skin, lung, breast). Localizing CN signs: anosmia (I), visual field defects (II), EOM palsies (III/IV/VI), hearing loss/tinnitus (VIII). Screen primary tumors that met to brain: lung, breast, melanoma, renal, colon. “B” Sx: wt loss, night sweats, chronic fatigue"
